<h1 id="wbr-presbyterian-church-cms----technical-specification">WBR
Presbyterian Church CMS -- Technical Specification</h1>
<h2 id="1-overview">1. Overview</h2>
<h3 id="11-project-summary">1.1 Project Summary</h3>
<p>A Content Management System for a Presbyterian church that manages
three core domains: church events (with calendar display), image
galleries (hosted on Cloudinary), and church member records (for
administrative use). All content is publicly viewable, while all
create/update/delete operations are restricted to authenticated
administrators.</p>
