<h2 id="5-controllers">5. Controllers</h2>
<h3 id="51-pagescontroller">5.1 PagesController</h3>
<ul>
<li><code>home</code> -- Queries
<code>Event.this_week.includes(:image)</code> and
<code>Member.birthdays_this_month</code>.</li>
<li>Auth: <code>allow_unauthenticated_access</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="52-eventscontroller">5.2 EventsController</h3>
<ul>
<li>Full CRUD: <code>index</code>, <code>show</code>, <code>new</code>,
<code>create</code>, <code>edit</code>, <code>update</code>,
<code>destroy</code></li>
<li><code>index</code> supports optional <code>category</code> filter
param. Eager-loads images.</li>
<li><code>new</code>/<code>edit</code> load <code>Image.all</code> for
image selector.</li>
<li>Auth:
<code>allow_unauthenticated_access only: [:index, :show]</code></li>
<li>Strong params:
<code>params.expect(event: [:title, :description, :event_date, :start_time, :end_time, :location, :category, :image_id])</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="53-calendarcontroller">5.3 CalendarController</h3>
<ul>
<li><code>show</code> -- Accepts optional <code>month</code>,
<code>year</code>, and <code>category</code> params. Defaults to current
month. Queries
<code>Event.for_month(date).by_category(category).includes(:image)</code>.
Groups by date.</li>
<li>Response wrapped in Turbo Frame for month navigation.</li>
<li>Auth: <code>allow_unauthenticated_access</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="54-galleriescontroller">5.4 GalleriesController</h3>
<ul>
<li>Full CRUD plus <code>reorder</code></li>
<li><code>index</code> -- Public visitors see only
<code>Gallery.published</code>; authenticated users see all.</li>
<li><code>show</code> -- Displays gallery with ordered images.</li>
<li><code>edit</code> -- Loads <code>Image.all</code> for image picker
and current ordered images.</li>
<li><code>update</code> -- Accepts <code>image_ids: []</code> to sync
assignments.</li>
<li><code>reorder</code> -- Accepts <code>{ ordered_ids: [...] }</code>,
updates positions in a transaction.</li>
<li>Auth:
<code>allow_unauthenticated_access only: [:index, :show]</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="55-adminimagescontroller">5.5 Admin::ImagesController</h3>
<ul>
<li><code>index</code> -- Lists all uploaded images with
thumbnails.</li>
<li><code>new</code> -- Upload form.</li>
<li><code>create</code> -- Sends file to Cloudinary, stores metadata in
<code>Image</code> model.</li>
<li><code>destroy</code> -- Removes from Cloudinary and database.</li>
<li>Auth: All actions require authentication.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="56-memberscontroller">5.6 MembersController</h3>
<ul>
<li>Full CRUD: <code>index</code>, <code>show</code>, <code>new</code>,
<code>create</code>, <code>edit</code>, <code>update</code>,
<code>destroy</code></li>
<li><code>index</code> lists members alphabetically.</li>
<li>Auth: All actions require authentication.</li>
<li>Strong params:
<code>params.expect(member: [:first_name, :last_name, :email, :phone, :address_line1, :address_line2, :city, :state, :zip_code, :date_of_birth])</code></li>
</ul>
