<h2 id="8-calendar-view">8. Calendar View</h2>
<h3 id="81-technical-approach">8.1 Technical Approach</h3>
<p>Server-rendered HTML grid using a 7-column CSS grid with Tailwind.
Month navigation uses a Turbo Frame so only the calendar grid is
replaced on prev/next clicks.</p>
<h3 id="82-controller-logic">8.2 Controller Logic</h3>
<pre class="ruby"><code>class CalendarController &lt; ApplicationController
  allow_unauthenticated_access

  def show
    @date = parse_date_params
    @category = params[:category]
    @events = Event.for_month(@date).by_category(@category).includes(:image)
    @events_by_date = @events.group_by(&amp;:event_date)
  end

  private

  def parse_date_params
    if params[:month].present? &amp;&amp; params[:year].present?
      Date.new(params[:year].to_i, params[:month].to_i, 1)
    else
      Date.current
    end
  end
end</code></pre>
<h3 id="83-view-structure">8.3 View Structure</h3>
<pre class="erb"><code>&lt;h1&gt;Church Calendar&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;%# Category filter links (outside Turbo Frame) %&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
  &lt;%= link_to &quot;All&quot;, calendar_path(month: @date.month, year: @date.year) %&gt;
  &lt;% Event::CATEGORY_LABELS.each do |value, label| %&gt;
    &lt;%= link_to label, calendar_path(month: @date.month, year: @date.year, category: value) %&gt;
  &lt;% end %&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;%# Turbo Frame wraps the calendar for month navigation %&gt;
&lt;%= turbo_frame_tag &quot;calendar_frame&quot; do %&gt;
  &lt;%# Month navigation arrows %&gt;
  &lt;div&gt;
    &lt;%= link_to &quot;Previous&quot;, calendar_path(month: @date.prev_month.month, year: @date.prev_month.year, category: @category),
        data: { turbo_frame: &quot;calendar_frame&quot; } %&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;&lt;%= @date.strftime(&quot;%B %Y&quot;) %&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;%= link_to &quot;Next&quot;, calendar_path(month: @date.next_month.month, year: @date.next_month.year, category: @category),
        data: { turbo_frame: &quot;calendar_frame&quot; } %&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;%# Day-of-week headers %&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;grid grid-cols-7&quot;&gt;
    &lt;% %w[Sun Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat].each do |day_name| %&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;font-bold text-center p-2&quot;&gt;&lt;%= day_name %&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;% end %&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;%# Calendar grid %&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;grid grid-cols-7&quot;&gt;
    &lt;%# Leading empty cells %&gt;
    &lt;% @date.beginning_of_month.wday.times do %&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;border p-2 bg-gray-50 min-h-24&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;% end %&gt;

    &lt;%# Day cells %&gt;
    &lt;% (@date.beginning_of_month..@date.end_of_month).each do |day| %&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;border p-2 min-h-24 &lt;%= &#39;bg-blue-50&#39; if day == Date.current %&gt;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;&lt;%= day.day %&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;% if @events_by_date[day].present? %&gt;
          &lt;% @events_by_date[day].each do |event| %&gt;
            &lt;%= link_to event.title, event_path(event),
                class: &quot;block text-sm truncate text-blue-700 hover:underline&quot; %&gt;
          &lt;% end %&gt;
        &lt;% end %&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;% end %&gt;

    &lt;%# Trailing empty cells %&gt;
    &lt;% (6 - @date.end_of_month.wday).times do %&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;border p-2 bg-gray-50 min-h-24&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;% end %&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;</code></pre>
