<h2 id="14-implementation-order">14. Implementation Order</h2>
<h3 id="phase-1-foundation-authentication--layout">Phase 1: Foundation
(Authentication + Layout)</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Uncomment <code>bcrypt</code> in Gemfile, run
<code>bundle install</code></li>
<li>Run <code>bin/rails generate authentication</code></li>
<li>Run migrations</li>
<li>Update <code>application.html.erb</code> with navbar, flash, footer
partials</li>
<li>Create <code>PagesController</code> with <code>home</code> action
and basic homepage</li>
<li>Set <code>root "pages#home"</code> in routes</li>
<li>Add seed data for admin user</li>
<li>Run <code>rails db:create db:migrate db:seed</code></li>
<li>Verify login/logout flow</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="phase-2-member-management">Phase 2: Member Management</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Generate Member model and migration</li>
<li>Add validations, scopes, instance methods</li>
<li>Create MembersController with full CRUD</li>
<li>Create member views</li>
<li>Add ordinal date helpers to ApplicationHelper</li>
<li>Add "Birthdays This Month" to homepage</li>
<li>Write model and controller tests</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="phase-3-event-management">Phase 3: Event Management</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Generate Event model and migration (without <code>image_id</code> --
added in Phase 4)</li>
<li>Add category constant, validations, scopes</li>
<li>Create EventsController with full CRUD</li>
<li>Create event views with category filter</li>
<li>Add events helper for category badges</li>
<li>Add "This Week's Events" to homepage</li>
<li>Write model and controller tests</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="phase-4-image-management-cloudinary">Phase 4: Image Management
(Cloudinary)</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Add <code>cloudinary</code> gem, <code>bundle install</code></li>
<li>Add Cloudinary credentials to Rails credentials</li>
<li>Create Cloudinary initializer</li>
<li>Generate Image model and migration</li>
<li>Add URL generation methods</li>
<li>Create <code>Admin::ImagesController</code> and views</li>
<li>Pin <code>sortablejs</code> in importmap</li>
<li>Add <code>image_id</code> column to events via migration</li>
<li>Update Event model and form with image selector</li>
<li>Write tests with Cloudinary API stubbing</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="phase-5-gallery-management">Phase 5: Gallery Management</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Generate Gallery and GalleryImage models and migrations</li>
<li>Add associations, validations, position logic</li>
<li>Create GalleriesController with CRUD + <code>reorder</code></li>
<li>Create gallery views with image picker and sortable list</li>
<li>Create <code>sortable_controller.js</code> Stimulus controller</li>
<li>Create <code>lightbox_controller.js</code> Stimulus controller</li>
<li>Write model, controller, and system tests</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="phase-6-calendar">Phase 6: Calendar</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Create CalendarController</li>
<li>Create calendar views with Turbo Frame</li>
<li>Add category filter</li>
<li>Write controller and system tests</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="phase-7-polish-and-testing">Phase 7: Polish and Testing</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Write remaining system tests</li>
<li>Create <code>flash_controller.js</code> and
<code>image_preview_controller.js</code></li>
<li>Responsive design review</li>
<li>Accessibility review</li>
<li>Run full test suite, Brakeman, RuboCop</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="phase-8-deployment-railway">Phase 8: Deployment (Railway)</h3>
<ol type="1">
<li>Create Railway account and project, connect GitHub repo</li>
<li>Add PostgreSQL database service in Railway dashboard</li>
<li>Update <code>config/database.yml</code> production section to use
<code>DATABASE_URL</code> for all four databases (primary, cache, queue,
cable), with <code>migrations_paths</code> set for each secondary
database</li>
<li>Create migration files for secondary databases:
<ul>
<li><code>db/cache_migrate/20260101000001_create_solid_cache_entries.rb</code></li>
<li><code>db/queue_migrate/20260101000002_create_solid_queue_tables.rb</code></li>
<li><code>db/cable_migrate/20260101000003_create_solid_cable_messages.rb</code></li>
<li>Version numbers must be unique across all migration files (they
share one <code>schema_migrations</code> table)</li>
</ul></li>
<li>Enable <code>assume_ssl</code> and <code>force_ssl</code> in
<code>config/environments/production.rb</code></li>
<li>Push to GitHub to trigger auto-deploy</li>
<li>In Railway dashboard, go to Postgres service → Variables and copy
the literal values for <code>POSTGRES_USER</code>,
<code>POSTGRES_PASSWORD</code>, <code>RAILWAY_TCP_PROXY_DOMAIN</code>,
and <code>RAILWAY_TCP_PROXY_PORT</code></li>
<li>Manually construct and set <code>DATABASE_URL</code> in the web
service Variables tab:
<code>postgresql://postgres:&lt;POSTGRES_PASSWORD&gt;@&lt;RAILWAY_TCP_PROXY_DOMAIN&gt;:&lt;RAILWAY_TCP_PROXY_PORT&gt;/railway</code></li>
<li>Set remaining environment variables: <code>RAILS_MASTER_KEY</code>,
<code>RAILS_ENV</code>, <code>RAILS_SERVE_STATIC_FILES</code>,
<code>SOLID_QUEUE_IN_PUMA</code></li>
<li>Install Railway CLI (<code>brew install railway</code>), link
project (<code>railway link</code>), create admin user
(<code>railway run bin/rails console</code>)</li>
<li>Configure custom domain (optional)</li>
</ol>
